# Feature: Warehouse Order and Shipment Management

**Feature ID:** 1  
**Branch pattern:** `feature/1-order-shipment-management`  
**Status:** Draft  
**Created:** 2026-09-28  
**Input:** Manage supplier orders and shipment information so warehouse personnel can record, track, and process warehouse orders and deliveries.  
**Depends on:** None  
**Related:** Bill of Lading; Supplier Order Form  

---

## User Stories

### US-1.1: Create Supplier Order
**As a** warehouse employee  
**I want to** create a supplier order containing the supplier, customer number, order date, P.O. number, and product information  
**So that** the warehouse can keep a record of products ordered from a manufacturer.

**Priority:** P1  
**Independent test:** Create a supplier order with valid supplier and product information and verify that the order is saved with all entered information.  
**Acceptance scenarios:** see ### US-1.1 under Acceptance Criteria

### US-1.2: Record Shipment Information
**As a** warehouse employee  
**I want to** record shipment information including the destination, source, customer number, P.O. number, driver, and shipped date  
**So that** the warehouse can keep track of outgoing shipments.

**Priority:** P1  
**Independent test:** Create a shipment using valid bill-of-lading information and verify that the shipment contains the entered destination, source, customer, P.O. number, driver, and shipped date.  
**Acceptance scenarios:** see ### US-1.2 under Acceptance Criteria

### US-1.3: Record Shipment Products
**As a** warehouse employee  
**I want to** record the SKU, description, quantity or cases, price, and total for products  
**So that** the warehouse can identify and account for the products included in an order or shipment.

**Priority:** P1  
**Independent test:** Add a product to an order or shipment and verify that its SKU, description, quantity/cases, price, and total are recorded.  
**Acceptance scenarios:** see ### US-1.3 under Acceptance Criteria

### US-1.4: Record Delivery and Receiving Information
**As a** warehouse employee  
**I want to** record the delivery date and receiving information  
**So that** the warehouse has a record of when a shipment was delivered and received.

**Priority:** P1  
**Independent test:** Enter a delivery date and receiving information for a shipment and verify that both values are stored with the shipment.  
**Acceptance scenarios:** see ### US-1.4 under Acceptance Criteria

