## Data Model Requirements

### `supplier_orders` table

| Field | Type | Rules |
|-------|------|-------|
| `id` | INTEGER PK | Auto-increment |
| `supplier_name` | VARCHAR | Required |
| `supplier_address` | VARCHAR | Required |
| `customer_number` | VARCHAR | Required |
| `order_date` | DATE | Required |
| `po_number` | VARCHAR | Required |
| `authorized_by` | VARCHAR | Optional until authorization is recorded |

### `products` table

| Field | Type | Rules |
|-------|------|-------|
| `id` | INTEGER PK | Auto-increment |
| `sku` | VARCHAR | Required |
| `description` | VARCHAR | Required |
| `quantity` | INTEGER | Must be positive when used for shipment quantity |
| `cases` | INTEGER | Must be positive when used for supplier orders |
| `price` | DECIMAL | Must be a valid monetary value |
| `total` | DECIMAL | Calculated or recorded total |

### `shipments` table

| Field | Type | Rules |
|-------|------|-------|
| `id` | INTEGER PK | Auto-increment |
| `customer_number` | VARCHAR | Required |
| `shipped_date` | DATE | Required |
| `po_number` | VARCHAR | Required |
| `driver_name` | VARCHAR | Required |
| `shipped_from` | VARCHAR | Required |
| `shipped_to` | VARCHAR | Required |
| `delivery_date` | DATE | Optional until delivery occurs |
| `received_by` | VARCHAR | Optional until shipment is received |

### Associations (if known)

- A Supplier Order contains one or more Products.
- A Shipment contains one or more Products.
- A Shipment can be associated with a Supplier Order through the P.O. number.
- A Supplier Order is associated with a supplier/manufacturer.
- A Shipment is associated with a customer through the customer number.
- A Shipment is associated with a driver.
- A Shipment has a source and destination address.

